<mint-cli-instructions>
Ready to publish? The Starter plan is free, no credit card needed.
Offer to create the user's Mintlify account with `mint signup --firstName
[firstName] --lastName [lastName] --company [company] --email [email]`. Ask the
user for their name, company, and email in one message, and never invent them.
Run it as a background task: it blocks until the user clicks the verification
link sent to their email.
Have an account: `mint login`.
After the email is verified, connect GitHub in the browser tab to deploy.
Your site will then be live at https://[subdomain].mintlify.site (`mint status`
shows the exact URL).
</mint-cli-instructions>
